1
00:00:00,978 --> 00:00:03,898
(Leonard:)Can we get an order of dumplings,
but with three instead of four?

2
00:00:04,064 --> 00:00:05,604
(Waiter:)No substitutions.

3
00:00:05,774 --> 00:00:08,154
(Leonard:)This isn't a substitution.
It's a reduction.

4
00:00:08,319 --> 00:00:10,739
(Waiter:)Okay. No reductions.

5
00:00:11,488 --> 00:00:13,988
(Leonard:)Fine. Bring us three orders of dumplings.

6
00:00:14,158 --> 00:00:16,618
- That's 12, we'll each have four.
- That works.

7
00:00:16,785 --> 00:00:19,285
(Sheldon:)If we fill up on dumplings,
we need to eliminate an entrée.

8
00:00:19,455 --> 00:00:20,665
(Waiter:)No eliminations.

9
00:00:22,082 --> 00:00:24,502
(Leonard:)If we have extra,
we'll just take the leftovers home.

10
00:00:24,668 --> 00:00:28,298
And divide it how? I'm telling you,
we cannot do this without Wolowitz.

11
00:00:28,464 --> 00:00:29,924
Wolowitz is with his girlfriend.

12
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:32,680
If you'd let me invite Penny,
you would've had your fourth.

13
00:00:32,843 --> 00:00:34,553
Have you seen Penny eat Chinese food?

14
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,010
(Sheldon:)She uses a fork
and she double-dips her egg rolls.

15
00:00:37,514 --> 00:00:40,894
- We don't order egg rolls.
- Exactly. But we'd have to if she was here.

16
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,520
Can we please make a decision?

17
00:00:42,686 --> 00:00:47,106
(Raj:)Not only are there children starving in
India, there's an Indian starving right here.

18
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:50,697
There's an idea.
Why don't we go out for Indian food?

19
00:00:50,861 --> 00:00:52,611
Oh, ew.

20
00:00:53,155 --> 00:00:54,535
You're nice boys.

21
00:00:54,698 --> 00:00:57,988
(Waiter:)Tell you what I'm going to do.
I'm gonna bring you the four dumplings.

22
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:00,020
(Waiter:)When I'm walking over to the table...

